---
# Starting profile. The repo passes `basic` with the deferrals below; the
# intent is to retire entries from skip_list one at a time rather than to keep
# them forever. Raising the profile to `moderate` is a later goal.
profile: basic

exclude_paths:
  - .venv/
  - .github/

# Each of these is a real improvement, deferred only because verifying the fix
# needs a live Proxmox run. The host they run against is disposable (see the
# hardware-gated backlog in docs/roadmap.md), so a failed run costs a rebuild
# rather than data — these are best batched into one lab session rather than
# retired one cautious rule at a time.
skip_list:
  # 29 hits. Bare `command`/`shell`/`set_fact` rather than ansible.builtin.*.
  # Mechanical, but it touches nearly every playbook at once.
  - fqcn
  # 25 hits. Several are genuine idempotency bugs and several are correct
  # as-written (pveum reconcile tasks that really do change state every run).
  # Needs task-by-task judgement, not a blanket fix.
  - no-changed-when
  # 9 hits. Adding `set -o pipefail` changes failure semantics of shell tasks
  # that currently tolerate a failing pipe stage. Needs a hardware run.
  - risky-shell-pipe
  # 5 hits. Task/play name casing only.
  - name
